questions.explanation:
Potential energy of a spring

= ${1 \over 2} \times$ force constant $\times$  (extension)^{2}

$\therefore$ Potential energy $\propto$ (extension)^{2}

or, ${{{U_1}} \over {{U_2}}} = {( {{{{x_1}} \over {{x_2}}}} )^2}$ or, ${{{U_1}} \over {{U_2}}} = {( {{2 \over 8}} )^2} \Rightarrow {{{U_1}} \over {{U_2}}} = {1 \over {16}} \Rightarrow {U_2} = 16{U_1} = 16U\,\,( {\because{U_1} = U} )$

